WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:06.565
The Carters were at a fall festival.

2
00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:10.474
First they picked pumpkins.

3
00:00:10.475 --> 00:00:13.884
Next they ate apple donuts.

4
00:00:13.885 --> 00:00:21.121
"I love donuts!" Oliver said.

5
00:00:21.122 --> 00:00:25.523
He grabbed a second donut.

6
00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:30.198
Then it was time for the cornstalk maze.

7
00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:36.675
"Stick with me and don't get lost," Dad said.

8
00:00:36.676 --> 00:00:41.499
"Don't you get lost," Mom said to Dad.

9
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.275
"I won't!" Dad laughed.

10
00:00:46.276 --> 00:00:49.075
"I'm an expert at mazes."

11
00:00:49.076 --> 00:00:54.630
Mom smiled. "I'll wait at the exit."

12
00:00:54.631 --> 00:01:02.010
The kids followed Dad into the maze.

13
00:01:02.011 --> 00:01:08.957
"These cornstalks are big," Oliver said.

14
00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:15.349
"The path has so many turns," Emmy said.

15
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:23.233
"Stop!" Harry shouted. "I have to tie my shoe."

16
00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:26.424
Oliver and Emmy stopped and waited.

17
00:01:26.425 --> 00:01:32.314
But Dad kept walking ahead.

18
00:01:32.315 --> 00:01:36.391
Emmy gulped. "We lost Dad!

19
00:01:36.392 --> 00:01:39.758
I don't know whether to go left or right."

20
00:01:39.759 --> 00:01:46.581
"Don't worry." Oliver patted her hand.

21
00:01:46.582 --> 00:01:50.553
"I'll drop donut crumbs."

22
00:01:50.554 --> 00:01:54.190
Emmy looked puzzled, but Harry nodded.

23
00:01:54.191 --> 00:01:58.383
"If we get lost, we'll see the crumbs," he said.

24
00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:04.774
"We'll follow them back here."

25
00:02:04.775 --> 00:02:10.832
It took a while, but the kids found the exit.

26
00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:17.946
Mom waved. "Where's Dad?"

27
00:02:17.947 --> 00:02:22.750
The kids shrugged.

28
00:02:22.751 --> 00:02:26.895
Ten minutes later Dad finally came out.

29
00:02:26.896 --> 00:02:31.499
"I got so lost!" he said.

30
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.761
"How did you finish first?"

31
00:02:35.762 --> 00:02:41.624
"I dropped donut crumbs," Oliver said.

32
00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:47.583
"And now I need another donut!"

